────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  What the replacement is told
  What the replacement is told: the card only (fresh), the handoff note, the
  note and the old session's transcript, or the note and a summary of it. A
  role's own setting wins

    1. fresh             The card only
    2. note              The handoff note: why it stopped and what's left
    3. note+transcript   The note, and the old session's transcript as a file
  ❯ 4. note+summary ✓    The note, with a summary of the old session
    5. Reset             remove it from this project's file

  Enter to choose · ↑↓ to move · type to filter · Esc to close
